question:
Fill in the blanks with appropriate numbers:  
(1) $1+ \_\_\_ =-10$;  
(2) $\_\_\_ - (+4.5) = -4.5$.

A certain online store monitored and statistically analyzed the sales price and sales volume of a seasonal product over the past $20$ days. The sales price $p$ (in yuan) on the $x$-th day ($1 \leqslant x \leqslant 20, x \in \mathbb{N}$) is given by $p= \begin{cases} 44+x,1 \leqslant x \leqslant 6 \\ 56-x,6 < x \leqslant 20 \end{cases}$, and the sales volume $q$ on the $x$-th day is given by $q= \begin{cases} 48-x,1 \leqslant x \leqslant 8 \\ 32+x,8 < x \leqslant 20 \end{cases}$. The cost of the product is known to be $25$ yuan per unit.

(I) Write the sales revenue $t$ as a function of the $x$-th day;
(II) Calculate the profit on the $7$-th day;
(III) On which day was the profit maximum? Calculate the maximum profit.
